  "finalText": "`paginate.js` was treating page numbers as 0-indexed, so `start = page * perPage` skipped a whole batch on every page. Since pages are documented as starting at 1, that's off by one page.\n\nFixed by changing it to `start = (page - 1) * perPage`.\n\nAll 5 tests pass now.",
